{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人江華與麥潔文（Kitman）結婚34年育有一對仔女。</p><p>大仔陳耀淙從事醫護界，細女陳薔天則加入樂壇，一家四口幸福滿瀉。</p><p>雖然江華1996年與鄧萃雯因合作劇集《我和春天有個約會》而擦出愛火，幸最後得太太原諒。</p><p>江華日前在社交平台分享一段與麥潔文台</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T14:21:38.714641+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T14:01:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T14:18:29.880926+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T14:18:29.880926+00:00","content_hash":"b02c379b764f4431b21c1e475c7e6be9b1060ef94d43757b287dbf7a6632ebe9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}